| Пакет | Содержимое |
|---|---|
| (корень) | `AeronauticsCouriers` — `@Mod`, подключение регистров, конфигов, событий |
| `registry` | `ModItems`, `ModBlocks`, `ModBlockEntities`, `ModComponents` (Data Components), `ModAttachments` (Data Attachments), `ModMenus`, `ModPayloads` — только `DeferredRegister`/регистрация |
| `config` | `CouriersServerConfig` (`aerocouriers-server.toml`), `CouriersClientConfig` (`aerocouriers-client.toml`) |
| `command` | `/couriers ...` (Brigadier) |
| `license` | `PilotLicenseItem` (`ICurioItem`), `LicenseOwner`, `LicenseRank`, `CourierProfile` (record + Codec), `Licenses` (поиск в Curios), `LicenseMigration` |
| `contract` | `Contract` (+ `preplaced`), `CargoContainers`, `ContractManager`/`Escrow`/`Mailbox`, `RankRules`, `Pricing`, `Weights` |
| `village` | `PostStationBlock` (+BE), `StationAtlas`, `StationNames`, `VillageStructures`, `VillageCargo`, `StationContractSource implements ContractSource` |
| `cargo` | `CargoContainerBlock` (+`FILL`), `CargoContainerBlockEntity`, `CargoSpawner`, `SableBridge` |
